<section class="decline-section" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="decline-bg">
    <div class="decline-bg-gradient"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="decline-inner">
    <h2 class="decline-heading">THE DECLINE OF T:<br><span class="decline-heading-accent">A MODERN EPIDEMIC</span></h2>

    <div class="decline-body">
      <div class="decline-chart-col">
        <div class="decline-chart-placeholder">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          <span>Chart placeholder</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="decline-text-col">
        <p class="decline-para"><span class="decline-highlight">Testosterone levels</span> have been dropping by 1% every year since 1980. Stress, poor sleep, processed diets, and toxins are destroying natural hormone production.</p>
        <p class="decline-para">The impact? Low testosterone drains energy, strength, and focus&mdash;making it harder to perform at your best in life and the gym.</p>
        <p class="decline-para"><span class="decline-good-news">The good news:</span> Chad Bites helps you reclaim your edge with natural testosterone support for energy, focus, and strength.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Decline of T",
  "class": "decline-section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "chart_image",
      "label": "Chart image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "background_image",
      "label": "Background image"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Decline of T"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
